{"id": "8b4eb607-e439-4aeb-9745-f7789a0df863", "slug": "system-initialization-1", "title": "System Initialization", "description": "System Initialization UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"System Initialization\"\ndescription: \"System Initialization UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#E88D79\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#8AA2C8\"\n  background: \"#F4F3EE\"\n  surface: \"#8AA2C8\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#A3A198\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"24px\"\n  control: \"16px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# System Initialization\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 8; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: testimonial, section, animated, social-proof.\n## Overview\nSystem Initialization UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nArchival Study · 04 System Status // Awaiting Input Terminal Mk.II System Configuration Required authorizations to initialize optimal operational parameters. Optical Feed Link Grants access to visual capture protocols.…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: System Configuration; Optical Feed Link; Tactile Input Relay; Telemetry Transmission.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #E88D79, secondary #000000, accent #8AA2C8, background #F4F3EE, surface #8AA2C8, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>System Initialization</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js for WebGL Shader -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', '-apple-system', 'BlinkMacSystemFont', 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', 'Helvetica', 'Arial', 'sans-serif'],\n                        serif: ['\"Playfair Display\"', 'Georgia', 'Cambria', '\"Times New Roman\"', 'Times', 'serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        app: {\n                            shell: '#EBE9DF',\n                            shellDark: '#D4D2C6',\n                            bezel: '#0A0A0A',\n                            textOuter: '#4A4A48',\n                            textInner: '#F3F4F6',\n                            textMuted: '#A1A1AA',\n                            accent: '#E88D79', // Coral-orange\n                            success: '#8AA2C8', // Cornflower blue as success\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#F4F3EE] text-app-textOuter font-sans antialiased min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden selection:bg-app-accent selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Directive: Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-between max-w-[1200px] mx-auto z-0 opacity-30 px-8 hidden lg:flex\">\n        <!-- Left Line -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#C2C0B6] to-transparent\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-[3px] top-[15%] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-[#A3A198] bg-[#F4F3EE]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-[3px] bottom-[15%] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-[#A3A198] bg-[#F4F3EE]\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Line -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-[1px] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#C2C0B6] to-transparent\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-[3px] top-[15%] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-[#A3A198] bg-[#F4F3EE]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-[3px] bottom-[15%] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-[#A3A198] bg-[#F4F3EE]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Peripheral Editorial Text -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-8 left-8 text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase text-app-textOuter/60 hidden md:block select-none\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg);\">\n        Archival Study &middot; 04\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-8 text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase text-app-textOuter/60 hidden md:block select-none\">\n        System Status // Awaiting Input\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Object: Retro-Futurist Monitor Shell -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[800px] mx-4 bg-app-shell rounded-[24px] border border-white/50 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8),inset_0_-4px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] p-4 md:p-6 flex flex-col transform-gpu\" id=\"hardware-shell\">\n\n        <!-- Outer Casing Details -->\n        <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center mb-4 px-2\">\n            <!-- Mac-style Hardware Indicators -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF5F56] shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#FFBD2E] shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#27C93F] shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase text-app-textOuter/50 font-medium\">Terminal Mk.II</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bezel -->\n        <div class=\"w-full bg-app-bezel rounded-[16px] p-2 md:p-3 shadow-[inset_0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),0_2px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)]\">\n\n            <!-- CRT/Glass Screen Interface -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full h-full min-h-[500px] max-h-[75vh] rounded-[10px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col shadow-[inset_0_0_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] bg-black\" id=\"screen-container\">\n\n                <!-- WebGL Background Shader Canvas -->\n                <div id=\"shader-canvas-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Subtle Screen Glare/Reflection -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-tr from-transparent via-white/5 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Interface Content Scroll Area -->\n                <div class=\"relative z-20 w-full h-full flex flex-col p-6 md:p-10 overflow-y-auto\" style=\"scrollbar-width: none;\">\n\n                    <div class=\"max-w-xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col h-full\">\n\n                        <!-- Header -->\n                        <div class=\"mb-10 text-center\">\n                            <!-- Directive: Masked Reveal Header -->\n                            <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-3 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-[0.2em]\" id=\"reveal-title\">\n                                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"inline-block reveal-word\">System</span></span>\n                                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"inline-block reveal-word text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#E5A993] to-[#E88D79]\">Configuration</span></span>\n                            </h1>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-white/70 font-sans tracking-wide reveal-fade opacity-0\">\n                                Required authorizations to initialize optimal operational parameters.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Configuration Modules List -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 reveal-fade opacity-0 flex-grow\">\n\n                            <!-- Directive: Border Gradients (Applied to all module cards) -->\n\n                            <!-- Module 1 -->\n                            <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden group\">\n                                <span class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-white/0 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></span>\n                                <div class=\"relative bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[11px] p-5 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 border border-white/5 shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                                    <div class=\"max-w-[300px]\">\n                                        <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white mb-1 tracking-wide\">Optical Feed Link</h3>\n                                        <p class=\"text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">\n                                            Grants access to visual capture protocols. A system refresh may be required post-authorization.\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-black/40 hover:bg-black/60 border border-white/10 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-white/90 transition-all duration-300 w-full md:w-auto shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] active:scale-[0.98]\">\n                                            Establish Link\n                                        </button>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Module 2 -->\n                            <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden group\">\n                                <span class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-white/0 opacity-50 transition-opacity duration-500\"></span>\n                                <div class=\"relative bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[11px] p-5 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 border border-white/5 shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                                    <div class=\"max-w-[300px]\">\n                                        <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white mb-1 tracking-wide\">Tactile Input Relay</h3>\n                                        <p class=\"text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">\n                                            Permits monitoring of peripheral inputs and keystroke metrics during active sessions.\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#8AA2C8]/10 border border-[#8AA2C8]/30 flex items-center gap-2 w-full md:w-auto justify-center shadow-[inset_0_0_10px_rgba(138,162,200,0.1)]\">\n                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-[#8AA2C8] text-base\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-[#8AA2C8] tracking-wide\">Secured</span>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Module 3 -->\n                            <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden group\">\n                                <span class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-white/0 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></span>\n                                <div class=\"relative bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[11px] p-5 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start justify-between gap-4 border border-white/5 shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                                    <div class=\"max-w-[320px]\">\n                                        <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white mb-1 tracking-wide\">Telemetry Transmission</h3>\n                                        <p class=\"text-xs text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-2\">\n                                            Aggregates diagnostic data to refine system architecture. Content payloads remain isolated.\n                                        </p>\n                                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[10px] text-[#E5A993] hover:text-[#E88D79] tracking-wider uppercase transition-colors\">Review Protocols</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"pt-1 flex justify-end\">\n                                        <!-- Custom Toggle -->\n                                        <button id=\"usage-toggle\" class=\"w-[38px] h-[20px] rounded-full relative transition-all duration-400 bg-app-accent shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(232,141,121,0.3)] border border-transparent\" aria-checked=\"true\" role=\"switch\">\n                                            <div class=\"absolute top-[2px] bottom-[2px] left-[2px] w-[14px] bg-white rounded-full transition-transform duration-400 transform translate-x-[18px] shadow-sm\" id=\"usage-toggle-knob\"></div>\n                                        </button>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Interface Footer -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col items-center reveal-fade opacity-0 delay-200\">\n\n                            <!-- Custom Checkbox -->\n                            <label class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer group mb-6\">\n                                <div class=\"relative w-4 h-4\">\n                                    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"terms-checkbox\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n                                    <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-[3px] border border-white/30 bg-black/20 peer-checked:bg-app-accent peer-checked:border-app-accent transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:border-white/50 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-linear\" class=\"text-white text-xs opacity-0 scale-50 peer-checked:opacity-100 peer-checked:scale-100 transition-all duration-300\" style=\"stroke-width: 2;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/60 select-none group-hover:text-white/90 transition-colors tracking-wide\">\n                                    I acknowledge the <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white/80 hover:text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-2\">Archival Directives</a> and <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white/80 hover:text-white underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-2\">Privacy Matrix</a>.\n                                </span>\n                            </label>\n\n                            <!-- Final Action Button wrapped in Directive: Border Gradient -->\n                            <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-lg w-full max-w-[240px] overflow-hidden group\">\n                                <span class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/30 to-white/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\" id=\"btn-glow\"></span>\n                                <button id=\"continue-btn\" disabled class=\"relative w-full py-2.5 rounded-[7px] text-xs font-medium text-white/40 bg-black/40 border border-white/10 cursor-not-allowed transition-all duration-500 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 backdrop-blur-md uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:lock-keyhole-linear\" class=\"text-sm opacity-50 transition-all duration-300\" id=\"btn-icon\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    Initialize\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Casing Vents (Decorative) -->\n        <div class=\"flex justify-center gap-4 mt-4 opacity-30\">\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-1 rounded-full bg-app-bezel shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-1 rounded-full bg-app-bezel shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-1 rounded-full bg-app-bezel shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Atmospheric Shader (Three.js) ---\n        // Creates a slow ambient background drift with muted cornflower, dusty peach, and coral\n        function initShader() {\n            const container = document.getElementById('shader-canvas-container');\n            if(!container) return;\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0.1, 10);\n            camera.position.z = 1;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: false, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2)); // optimize performance\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                uniforms: {\n                    u_time: { value: 0.0 },\n                    u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight) }\n                },\n                vertexShader: `\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n                    void main() {\n                        vUv = uv;\n                        gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `,\n                fragmentShader: `\n                    uniform float u_time;\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n\n                    // Palette based on prompt\n                    vec3 cornflower = vec3(0.54, 0.63, 0.78); // #8AA2C8\n                    vec3 peach = vec3(0.89, 0.66, 0.57);      // #E5A993\n                    vec3 coral = vec3(0.90, 0.55, 0.47);      // #E88D79\n                    vec3 charcoal = vec3(0.12, 0.12, 0.14);   // Dark base for depth\n\n                    // Simple 2D noise function\n                    float random (in vec2 st) {\n                        return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453123);\n                    }\n\n                    void main() {\n                        vec2 uv = vUv;\n\n                        // Slow fluid motion\n                        float t = u_time * 0.15;\n\n                        // Create overlapping sine waves for soft atmospheric drift\n                        float wave1 = sin(uv.x * 3.0 + t) * cos(uv.y * 2.0 - t * 0.8) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                        float wave2 = cos(uv.x * 2.5 - t * 1.2) * sin(uv.y * 3.5 + t * 0.5) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                        float wave3 = sin((uv.x + uv.y) * 2.0 + t) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n\n                        // Mix colors based on waves\n                        vec3 color = mix(charcoal, cornflower, wave1 * 0.8 + 0.2); // Base layer\n                        color = mix(color, peach, wave2 * 0.6);                    // Mid layer\n                        color = mix(color, coral, wave3 * 0.4 * wave1);            // Highlight layer\n\n                        // Add very subtle grain to avoid banding and add texture\n                        float grain = (random(uv + u_time) - 0.5) * 0.03;\n                        color += grain;\n\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            let time = 0;\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                time += 0.02;\n                material.uniforms.u_time.value = time;\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n            animate();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                const width = container.clientWidth;\n                const height = container.clientHeight;\n                renderer.setSize(width, height);\n                material.uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(width, height);\n            });\n        }\n\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        function initGSAP() {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ delay: 0.2 });\n\n            // Tactile hardware casing drop-in\n            tl.fromTo(\"#hardware-shell\",\n                { scale: 0.98, opacity: 0, y: 10, rotationX: 2 },\n                { scale: 1, opacity: 1, y: 0, rotationX: 0, duration: 1.2, ease: \"power3.out\" }\n            );\n\n            // Directive: Masked Word Reveal\n            tl.fromTo(\".reveal-word\",\n                { y: \"110%\", rotateZ: 2 },\n                { y: \"0%\", rotateZ: 0, duration: 1, stagger: 0.15, ease: \"power4.out\" },\n                \"-=0.6\"\n            );\n\n            // Fade in glass interface elements sequentially\n            tl.fromTo(\".reveal-fade\",\n                { opacity: 0, y: 10, filter: \"blur(4px)\" },\n                { opacity: 1, y: 0, filter: \"blur(0px)\", duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.15, ease: \"power2.out\" },\n                \"-=0.5\"\n            );\n        }\n\n        // --- Interactivity ---\n        function initInteractions() {\n            // Usage Toggle Logic\n            const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('usage-toggle');\n            const toggleKnob = document.getElementById('usage-toggle-knob');\n            let isToggled = true;\n\n            toggleBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                isToggled = !isToggled;\n                toggleBtn.setAttribute('aria-checked', isToggled);\n\n                if (isToggled) {\n                    toggleBtn.classList.remove('bg-white/20', 'shadow-none', 'border-white/10');\n                    toggleBtn.classList.add('bg-app-accent', 'shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(232,141,121,0.3)]', 'border-transparent');\n                    toggleKnob.style.transform = 'translateX(18px)';\n                    toggleKnob.style.backgroundColor = 'white';\n                } else {\n                    toggleBtn.classList.remove('bg-app-accent', 'shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(232,141,121,0.3)]', 'border-transparent');\n                    toggleBtn.classList.add('bg-white/20', 'shadow-none', 'border-white/10');\n                    toggleKnob.style.transform = 'translateX(0px)';\n                    toggleKnob.style.backgroundColor = '#E5E7EB'; // slightly dim knob when off\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Checkbox -> Final Action Button State\n            const checkbox = document.getElementById('terms-checkbox');\n            const continueBtn = document.getElementById('continue-btn');\n            const btnIcon = document.getElementById('btn-icon');\n            const btnGlow = document.getElementById('btn-glow');\n\n            checkbox.addEventListener('change', (e) => {\n                if(e.target.checked) {\n                    // Enable State (Glassmorphic glow)\n                    continueBtn.removeAttribute('disabled');\n                    continueBtn.classList.remove('text-white/40', 'bg-black/40', 'cursor-not-allowed');\n                    continueBtn.classList.add('text-white', 'bg-white/20', 'hover:bg-white/30', 'shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]', 'cursor-pointer');\n                    btnIcon.setAttribute('icon', 'solar:arrow-right-linear');\n                    btnIcon.classList.remove('opacity-50');\n                    btnIcon.classList.add('translate-x-1');\n                    btnGlow.classList.replace('from-white/30', 'from-[#E5A993]/50'); // Match gradient\n                } else {\n                    // Disable State\n                    continueBtn.setAttribute('disabled', 'true');\n                    continueBtn.classList.add('text-white/40', 'bg-black/40', 'cursor-not-allowed');\n                    continueBtn.classList.remove('text-white', 'bg-white/20', 'hover:bg-white/30', 'shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]', 'cursor-pointer');\n                    btnIcon.setAttribute('icon', 'solar:lock-keyhole-linear');\n                    btnIcon.classList.add('opacity-50');\n                    btnIcon.classList.remove('translate-x-1');\n                    btnGlow.classList.replace('from-[#E5A993]/50', 'from-white/30');\n                }\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Initialize on DOM Content Loaded\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initShader();\n            initGSAP();\n            initInteractions();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "system-initialization-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/system-initialization-1.jpg", "source_name": "system-initialization-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 60, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T06:04:21.678867+00:00"}